cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CaV1.2 Isoform Atlas"
message: "If you use this resource, please cite it and the primary papers it indexes."
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Adriana
    family-names: Hernandez Gonzalez
    email: ahgonzalez@ucdavis.edu
    affiliation: "University of California, Davis Health"
repository-code: "https://github.com/adrishg/Cav12_isoform_atlas"
url: "https://adrishg.github.io/Cav12_isoform_atlas/"
abstract: >-
  An evidence-tiered reference for CACNA1C / CaV1.2 alternative splicing across
  human, rat and rabbit. Includes verified exon sequences from UniProt VAR_SEQ
  records, a sequence-to-topology isoform checker, auxiliary subunit pairing,
  a 3D structure viewer for AlphaFold models, tissue and transcript-level
  expression, splicing regulation, and an indexed, filterable literature base.
keywords:
  - CACNA1C
  - CaV1.2
  - alternative splicing
  - L-type calcium channel
  - ion channel
license: CC-BY-4.0
